WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.155
Partition pruning means Spark can skip reading some
partitions when a filter matches the partition

00:00:05.182 --> 00:00:10.708
layout A date column can be useful if queries often
filter by date

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.295
range A unique ID is usually a poor partition column
because it can

00:00:16.321 --> 00:00:22.410
create many tiny partitions Partition design should
follow query patterns
